          "jcr:created": "Tue Apr 05 2022 14:11:26 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">We’re excited to see you this year at the 26th edition of LINNC Paris! As a gold sponsor, with platinum recognition, we’re proud to be part of this great congress.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">LINNC Paris 2023 Course</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Dates:</span> <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">June 5 - 7</span><br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\">Location:</span> <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Carrousel du Louvre, Paris, France</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The Stryker booth and technology suite will be located at Booth #6.<br>\n &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
