          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Monday, June 5, 2023</span><br>\n 19:00 - 22:30</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Maison des Polytechniciens</span><br>\n 12 Rue de Poitiers, 75007 Paris</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Treatment of Complex Wide Neck Aneurysms</span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Panel discussion on complex aneurysm treatments with:</b><ul>\n<li>Fritz Wodarg, of Universitätsklinikum Schleswig-Holstein, Kiel, Germany</li>\n<li>Alessandra Biondi, of University Hospital, Besançon, France</li>\n<li>Alejandro Tomasello, of Vall d’Hebron Hospital, Barcelona, Spain</li>\n<li>Monika Killer-Oberpfalzer of Paracelsus Medical University, Salzburg Austria</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><b>19:00 Aperitif</b></li>\n<li><b>20:30 Dinner</b></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please allow for a&nbsp;<b>15 minute</b>&nbsp;walking time from the Carrousel du Louvre.</p>\n",
