          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Welcome Cerus Endovascular.<br>\n Now part of Stryker.</span></span></p>\n<p>With the addition of Cerus Endovascular, we’re delivering a new level of ease-of-use and innovation to address broad range aneurysms.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">“</span>The addition of the Cerus Endovascular technology to Stryker’s portfolio enables us to offer a full suite of solutions to treat a variety of wide neck aneurysms safely and easily. We’re excited to bring this life-saving technology to our customers and their patients worldwide.<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">”</span><br>\n </span><b>- John Daniel, Ph.D., Vice President, R&amp;D</b></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed May 17 2023 19:27:05 GMT+0000",
